<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Dooly: Configuration-Agnostic, Redundancy-Aware Profiling for LLM Inference Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Operation Set Finder</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In Dooly: Configuration-Agnostic, Redundancy-Aware Profiling for LLM Inference Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Latency Database Schema</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A6" title="In Dooly: Configuration-Agnostic, Redundancy-Aware Profiling for LLM Inference Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">F </span>DoolySim: Simulation Accuracy</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In Dooly: Configuration-Agnostic, Redundancy-Aware Profiling for LLM Inference Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>Per-Batch Prediction Accuracy</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A8" title="In Dooly: Configuration-Agnostic, Redundancy-Aware Profiling for LLM Inference Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">H </span>Inversion Point Validation Across Configurations</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A9" title="In Dooly: Configuration-Agnostic, Redundancy-Aware Profiling for LLM Inference Simulation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">I </span>Profiling Overhead</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
</nav>
<div class="ltx_page_main">
<div id="infobox" class="infobox">
